1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,751
This is what happened to CS2's old cases after Valve stopped dropping them.

2
00:00:03,931 --> 00:00:05,805
A peak in May, ten percent up.

3
00:00:05,985 --> 00:00:07,993
Then down. And down again.

4
00:00:08,173 --> 00:00:10,516
Today, thirty-five percent below the high.

5
00:00:10,696 --> 00:00:17,026
Why? Daily sales are down forty-five percent since March. Supply froze, and so did the buyers.
